WEBVTT

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:04.375 line:0 align:center
Now, the Apps panel.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:08.475 line:0 align:center
On the dash, the nine-dot button in the dock opens it.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.100 line:0 align:center
You set it up on the Apps panel page.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.850 line:0 align:center
It slides in over the dash, and it has a fixed size.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:23.800 line:0 align:center
You build it like a dash, with cards and widgets.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.550 line:0 align:center
To add something, click Add to the panel.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.550 line:0 align:center
You'll find quick settings and apps, and a Controls card.

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:38.725 line:0 align:center
Further down: phone widgets, OBD sensors, and New column.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.700 line:0 align:center
A new card is filled with a widget automatically.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.800 line:0 align:center
Change it as you like, or remove it if you don't want it.

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:57.025 line:0 align:center
Each click on Buttons adds another Buttons card.

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:02.450 line:0 align:center
The panel's space is fixed, so use it wisely.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.925 line:0 align:center
Click a card to see its options.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.700 line:0 align:center
The Apps card shows apps from your phone.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:21.350 line:0 align:center
Choose what it shows:

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:26.475 line:0 align:center
apps on the head unit, in the same order as on your phone,

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:30.175 line:0 align:center
or only your music apps.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:35.050 line:0 align:center
Last opened keeps the apps you use most at the front.

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:40.650 line:0 align:center
If a card gets too small, give it more space.

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:45.950 line:0 align:center
Or remove a card to make room.

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:51.250 line:0 align:center
Click a Buttons card to see its buttons.

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:55.925 line:0 align:center
Each click on Add button adds one more, until the card is full.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:02.150 line:0 align:center
Every button has the usual options: what it does, text, icon and look.

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:06.925 line:0 align:center
It's a lot at first, so play with it. You can't break anything.

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:15.300 line:0 align:center
To keep your current dash, save under a new name, or click Discard.
